{"ID":"20240205165622-azgxsiu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205165622-azgxsiu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165622-azgxsiu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093548-gt8on8p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607095819-vznbr29\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618130656-9v6mdrg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"029女萎（玉竹、葳蕤、萎蕤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240731133303"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093548-gt8on8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093548-gt8on8p","updated":"20240206093557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、河南、江苏、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈长圆柱形，略扁，少有分枝，长418cm，直径0.31.6cm。表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，半透明，具纵皱纹及微隆起的环节，有白色圆点状的须根痕和圆盘状茎痕。质硬而脆或稍软，易折断，断面角质样或显颗粒性。气微，味甘，嚼之发黏。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t滋阴润肺；养胃生津。燥咳；劳嗽；热病阴液耗伤之咽干口渴；内热消渴；阴虚外感；头昏眩晕；筋脉挛痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093549-dta4tn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093549-dta4tn6","updated":"20240206093549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093549-m5brdji.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170150-prgxcwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170150-prgxcwf","updated":"20240205170150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹-20240205170150-0dyau9i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240618130610-mpfpeep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618130610-mpfpeep","updated":"20240618130610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 513px;","style":"width: 503px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618130610-r9ctqjj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 503px;\" parent-style=\"width: 513px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240618130154-cxxqu7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618130154-cxxqu7h","updated":"20240731130557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 482px;","style":"width: 472px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618130154-kfvyz39.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 472px;\" parent-style=\"width: 482px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹-20240618130504-0x627yw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731130635-qxmvtcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731130635-qxmvtcm","updated":"20240731133231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 431px;","style":"width: 421px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 11-20240731133231-amp792m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 421px;\" parent-style=\"width: 431px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 725px;","style":"width: 715px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 6-20240731130635-l8fruk9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 715px;\" parent-style=\"width: 725px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618130406-80342g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618130406-80342g4","updated":"20240731125720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 641px;","style":"width: 631px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618130406-ciah4nx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 631px;\" parent-style=\"width: 641px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 3-20240731125452-3fq4rci.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731125136-ib81jw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731125136-ib81jw3","updated":"20240731130838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 7-20240731130838-a9y06gd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 2-20240731125136-17lq4b4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731130914-mq5khwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731130914-mq5khwh","updated":"20240731132150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 349px;","style":"width: 339px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 9-20240731132042-o8zl70q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 339px;\" parent-style=\"width: 349px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 360px;","style":"width: 350px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 10-20240731132125-s0m60dx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 350px;\" parent-style=\"width: 360px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 411px;","style":"width: 401px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 8-20240731130914-6hejiun.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 401px;\" parent-style=\"width: 411px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731125556-cha3ao4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731125556-cha3ao4","updated":"20240731125710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 781px;","style":"width: 771px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 4-20240731125556-1qezs7n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 771px;\" parent-style=\"width: 781px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玉竹 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玉竹 5-20240731125646-k32h334.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731124754-czzif1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731124754-czzif1k","updated":"20240731124754"}},{"ID":"20240731115656-4sgswde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-4sgswde","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（多花）黄精、玉竹对比"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-p4hxw4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-p4hxw4x","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240731110544-untbt5s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-v449zko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-v449zko","updated":"20240731130458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（玉竹叶子与梗成四十五度或七十度角，黄精近九十度。）"}]},{"ID":"20240731132454-lefattf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731132454-lefattf","updated":"20240731132454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄精玉竹对比 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄精玉竹对比 2-20240731132454-g8l3t3m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731132323-eulgj9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731132323-eulgj9r","updated":"20240731132513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（玉竹叶片偏宽圆，黄精叶片偏窄尖；1为玉竹，2位黄精）"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-tecjie0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-tecjie0","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240731113521-yku1wjz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-7ztk1wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-7ztk1wj","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（玉竹花少，黄精花多）"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-e4dxngw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-e4dxngw","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240731114301-w5paoq3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-dew6oy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-dew6oy1","updated":"20240731115656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（玉竹像竹瘦长，黄精像姜圆大；玉竹较白，黄精颜色较黄；）"}]},{"ID":"20240731115656-trea2uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731115656-trea2uy","updated":"20240731133303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"其他辨别方法：黄精花腋生花梗较短，玉竹花梗较长；黄精茎直立生长比较粗，玉竹茎细小偏硬；黄精叶子狭长而尖，玉竹叶子较宽而圆；黄精较高，能长到2-3米，玉竹较矮，能长到60-70cm；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240731124559-46sk7js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731124559-46sk7js","updated":"20240731133150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：玉竹跟多花黄精较相似，注意甄别；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref strong","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205165632-d4ie9pp","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"黄精"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240731133145-c4rfgdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731133145-c4rfgdr","updated":"20240731133145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：黄精跟玉竹一样，根部都是一年长一节；"}]},{"ID":"20240616090714-f23pl7r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616090714-f23pl7r"}},{"ID":"20240616091013-23h4uj4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-23h4uj4","updated":"20240616091016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091013-37jizll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-37jizll","updated":"20240616091013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091013-uvjyysn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-uvjyysn","updated":"20240616091013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。久服，去面黑皯，好颜色，润泽，轻身不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091013-vy8lsbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-vy8lsbu","updated":"20240616091013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：女萎一名葳蕤，一名玉马，一名地节，一名虫蝉，一名乌萎，一名荧，一名玉竹，神农苦，一经甘，桐君雷公扁鹊甘无毒，黄帝辛，生太山山谷，叶青黄相值如姜，二月七月采，治中风暴热，久服轻身（《御览》），一名左眄，久服轻身耐老（同上）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091013-w4yh92c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-w4yh92c","updated":"20240616091013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名荧，一名地节，一名玉竹，一名马熏，生太山及邱陵，立春后采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091013-v6plehr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091013-v6plehr","updated":"20240616091013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《尔雅》云：荧委萎；郭璞云：药草也，叶似竹，大者如箭，竿，有节，叶狭而长，表白裹青，根大如指，长一二尺，可啖；陶宏景云：按本经有女萎，无萎蕤，别录有萎蕤，而为用正同，疑女萎即萎蕤也，惟名异耳；陈藏器云：魏志樊阿传，青粘，一名黄芝，一名地节，此即萎蕤。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091315-r29exjr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091315-r29exjr"}},{"ID":"20240616091316-1hiaqzc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-1hiaqzc","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-igxhj37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-igxhj37","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-r0h9poz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-r0h9poz","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"礼备之祥，所生唯和。王者之用，野人之节也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-ojmfofp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-ojmfofp","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】甘平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-g4pd4st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-g4pd4st","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主中风，暴热，不能动摇，跌筋，结肉，诸不足。久服去面 ，好颜色润泽，轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-qftvaq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-qftvaq0","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶尔雅名荧，又名萎移，萎香。别录名萎蕤，又名玉竹、地节。吴普名葳蕤。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-epvtpyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-epvtpyg","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"樊阿名青粘。先人云∶节竹其形，萎荧作象，玉青为色，风木之性也。生太山山谷，及滁州、舒州、汉中、均州，处处山中亦有。春生苗，茎强直，似竹作节，叶亦如竹，两两相值，叶端有黄色班点。三月开青花，遂结实如珠，根横行，如荻根及菖蒲。概节平直，多脂润，虽燥亦柔，须节冗密，宛如冠缨下垂之绥，而有威仪之义。瑞应图曰∶王者礼备，则萎蕤生于殿前，威仪之义，于此可见。修治，以竹刀刮去须，及皮节。洗净，蜜水浸一宿，蒸了，焙干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-xeewey5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-xeewey5","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先人云∶动摇名风；不能动摇，名中风。无风大性故泽色轻身，皆属风力所转。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-dtjc37c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-dtjc37c","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绍隆王先生云∶性禀醇和，如盛德君子，无往不利。故可资其利用而不穷。正如此药之能补益脏腑，滋培血气，气为阳，则身轻；血为阴，则颜驻。根本既治，百疾自除矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-o1o22y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-o1o22y2","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶体性柔软，津汁粘埴，根 繁盛，垂垂似缨，俨若威仪之容貌。以能卓立于礼，而为节文度数者也。故王者礼备，则葳蕤生于殿前。细观命名，其形状可想见矣。能立于礼，以固人肌肤之会，筋骸之束，若愉色婉容，手舞足蹈，莫非节文度数之详耳。其不能动摇，跌筋结肉，面 色黯，皆为慢风暴热之所困。以礼节之，默然感化，所谓动容貌，远暴慢者也。于是肌肤润泽，筋骸转摇，故身轻不老，翩翩若仙矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-qzt8t5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-qzt8t5y","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（杂记云∶蕤宾律名，谓五月一阴之气，委蕤于下。嵇康琴赋云∶飞英蕤于昊苍，则葳蕤上下察矣。诗云∶望见葳蕤举翠华，旋开金屋扫庭花。望幸者，尚尔飘飘神举∶宠幸者，想更超逾腾跃矣。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091342-mlmppoz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091342-mlmppoz"}},{"ID":"20240616091344-fap6e6h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091344-fap6e6h","updated":"20240616091349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091344-b5xdylk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091344-b5xdylk","updated":"20240616091344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温。主风寒洒洒，霍乱泄痢，肠鸣游气上下无常，惊痫寒热百病，出汗。李氏本草云∶止下，消食。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091344-z2kg2nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091344-z2kg2nv","updated":"20240616091344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶其叶似白蔹，蔓生，花白，子细。荆、襄之间名为女萎，亦名蔓楚。止痢有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091344-41qnruy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091344-41qnruy","updated":"20240616091344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具萎蕤条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091344-mpx9ghb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091344-mpx9ghb","updated":"20240616091344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡采得，阴干，去头并白蕊，于槐砧上锉，拌豆淋酒蒸。从巳至未出，晒令干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091330-dejn4zu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091330-dejn4zu"}},{"ID":"20240616091332-wrxy5pb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091332-wrxy5pb","updated":"20240616091336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091332-hgf4m2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091332-hgf4m2d","updated":"20240616091332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡采得，阴干，去头并白蕊，于槐砧上锉，拌豆，淋酒蒸，从巳至未，出，晒令干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-lha5nks","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-lha5nks","updated":"20240616091316"}},{"ID":"20240616091316-l637vpw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-l637vpw","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎（萎蕤）《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-1m7k1vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-1m7k1vp","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足，心腹结气，虚热湿毒，腰痛，茎中寒及目痛 烂泪出。久服去面黑 ，好颜色，润泽，轻身不老。一名荧，一名地节，一名王竹，一名马熏。生泰山山谷及丘陵。立春后采，阴干。（畏卤咸。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-1kbbg36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-1kbbg36","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶按《本经》有女萎，无萎蕤。《别录》无女萎，有萎蕤，而为用正同，疑女萎即萎蕤也，唯名异尔。今处处有，其根似黄精而小异，服食家亦用之。今市人别用一种物，根形状如续断茎，味至苦，乃言是女青根，出荆州。今疗下痢方多用女萎，而此都无止泄之说，疑必非也。萎蕤又主理诸石，人服石不调和者，煮汁饮之。唐本注云∶女萎功用及苗、蔓与萎蕤全别，列在中品。今《本经》朱书是女萎能效，墨字乃萎蕤之效。今以朱书为白字。臣禹锡等谨按尔雅云∶荧，委萎。释曰∶药草也。一名荧，一名委萎。叶似竹，大者如箭竿，有节，叶狭长而表白里青，根大如指，长一、二尺可啖。药性论云∶萎蕤，君。主时疾寒热，内补不足，去虚劳客热，头痛不安，加而用之良。陈藏器云∶女萎、葳蕤，二物同传，陶云同是一物，但名异耳。下痢方多用女萎，而此都无止泄之说，疑必非也。按∶女萎，苏又于中品之中出之。云主霍乱，泄痢，肠鸣，正与陶注上品女萎相会。如此即二萎功用同矣，更非二物，苏乃剩出一条。苏又云∶女萎与萎蕤不同，其萎蕤一名玉竹，为其似竹；一名地节，为其有节。《魏志·樊阿传》青粘，一名黄芝，一名地节，此即萎蕤，极似偏精。本功外，主聪明，调血气，令人强壮。和漆叶为散，主五脏，益精，去三虫，轻身不老，变白，润肌肤，暖腰脚。唯有热不可服。晋·嵇绍有胸中寒痰，每酒后苦唾，服之得愈。草似竹，取根、花、叶阴干。昔华佗入山，见仙人所服，以告樊阿，服之寿百岁也。萧炳云∶萎蕤，补中益气，出均州。日华子云∶除烦闷，止渴，润心肺，补五劳七伤虚损，腰脚疼痛，天行热狂，服食无忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-7w06viu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-7w06viu","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶萎蕤，生泰山山谷丘陵，今滁州、舒州及汉中皆有之。叶狭而长，表白里青，亦类黄精。茎秆强直，似竹箭秆有节。根黄多须，大如指，长一、二尺。或云可啖。三月开青花，结圆实。立春后采根阴干用之。《本经》与女萎同条，云是一物二名。又云自是二物，苗、蔓与功用全别。《尔雅》谓荧，委萎（上于为切，下人垂切）。郭璞注云∶药草也。亦无女萎之别名，疑别是一物，且《本经》中品，又别有女萎条。苏恭云∶即此女萎，今《本经》朱书是女萎能效，黑字是萎蕤之功，观古方书所用，则似差别。胡洽治时气洞下 下有女萎丸，治伤寒冷下结肠丸中用女萎，治虚劳小黄 酒云∶下痢者加女萎。详此数方所用，乃似中品女萎，缘其性温，主霍乱泄痢故也。又主贼风，手足枯痹，四肢拘挛，茵芋酒中用女萎。及《古今录验》治身体 疡斑剥女萎膏，乃似朱字女萎，缘其主中风不能动摇及去 好色故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-jc5go79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-jc5go79","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又治伤寒七、八日不解续命鳖甲汤，治脚弱鳖甲汤，并用萎蕤。及延年方∶主风热项急痛，四肢骨肉烦热，萎蕤饮；又主虚风热，发即头热萎蕤丸。乃似此黑字萎蕤，缘其主虚热湿毒，腰痛故也。三者主治既别，则非一物明矣。然陈藏器以为更非二物，是不然矣。此女萎性平，味甘；中品女萎味辛，性温。性味既殊，安得为一物。又云萎蕤一名地节，极似偏精，疑即青粘，华佗所服漆叶青粘散是此也。然世无复能辨者，非敢以为信然耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-rj1n8pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-rj1n8pn","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿用钩吻并黄精，其二物相似。萎蕤只是不同，有误疾人，萎蕤节上有毛，茎斑，叶尖处有小黄点，采得先用竹刀刮上节皮了，洗净，却以蜜水浸一宿，蒸了焙干用。外台秘要∶主发热口干，小便涩，萎蕤五两，煮汁饮之。杨氏产乳∶疗久痢脱肛不止。取女萎切一升，烧熏之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-pot8tfv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-pot8tfv","updated":"20240616091316"}},{"ID":"20240616091316-u5a8j76","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-u5a8j76","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-didcmug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-didcmug","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温。主风寒洒洒，霍乱，泄痢，肠鸣游气上下无常，惊痫寒热百病，出汗。《李氏本草》云∶止下，消食。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-9wqoj4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-9wqoj4v","updated":"20240616091316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其叶似白蔹，蔓生，花白，子细，荆襄之间名为女萎，亦名蔓楚，止痢有效。用苗不用根，与萎蕤全别。今太常谬以为白头翁者是也。（新附）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091316-foazpsi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091316-foazpsi","updated":"20240616091316"}},{"ID":"20240616091109-1ghbjj9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091109-1ghbjj9","updated":"20240616091116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女萎葳蕤《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091109-l7zubzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091109-l7zubzx","updated":"20240616091109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足，心腹结气，虚热湿毒，腰痛，茎中寒，及目痛 烂，泪出。久服去面黑 ，好颜色，润泽，轻身不老。一名荧，一名地节，一名玉竹，一名马熏。生太山山谷及丘陵，立春后采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091058-yznnpo5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091058-yznnpo5"}},{"ID":"20240616091059-iduy89m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091059-iduy89m","updated":"20240616091102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"萎蕤《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091059-edjgf2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091059-edjgf2y","updated":"20240616091059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】女萎。味甘平。主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。久服，去面黑皯，好颜色，润泽，轻身不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091059-gqkclaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091059-gqkclaf","updated":"20240616091059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，入手太阴肺经。清肺金而润燥，滋肝木而清风。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091059-jwj66yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091059-jwj66yh","updated":"20240616091059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄升麻汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在麻黄。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治厥阴病，咽喉不利，吐脓血者，以金受火刑，萎蕤清金而润燥也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091059-83igd9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091059-83igd9x","updated":"20240616091059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"萎蕤和平滋润，化气生津，解渴除烦，清金利水，益气润燥。其诸主治，止消渴，通淋涩，润皮肤，去黑（黑干），疗目眦赤烂，治眼睛昏花。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"即玉竹。《三国志华佗传》：以漆叶青黏散方，授弟子樊阿，谓可服食长生，青黏即玉竹叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091231-ax7etkd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091231-ax7etkd"}},{"ID":"20240616091250-zir7j8e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-zir7j8e","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳蕤《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-rnx0pv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-rnx0pv3","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘平，无毒。主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。久服去面黑 ，好颜色，润泽，轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-hqe83ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-hqe83ua","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《本经》名女萎。《吴氏本草》名葳蕤。《别录》名玉竹。《拾遗》名青粘。始出太山山谷及邱陵，今处处有之。女萎者，性阴柔而质滋润，如女之委顺相随也，葳蕤者，女子娇柔之意。玉竹者，根色如玉，茎节如竹也。青粘，茎叶青翠，根汁稠粘也。春生苗，茎直有节，其叶如竹，两两相对，其根横生如黄精，色白微黄，性柔多脂，最难干。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-c5erhjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-c5erhjx","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（按∶葳蕤叶密者，似乎对生，而实不相对。或云∶其叶对生者，即是黄精矣。今浙中采药拣根之细长者为玉竹，根之园而大者为黄精，其实只是一种年未久者，故根细而长。年久者，其根大而园。余求真黄精，种数十年不能得。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-763wgbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-763wgbv","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳蕤气味甘平，质多津液，禀太阴湿土之精，以资中焦之汁。中风暴热者，风邪中人，身热如曝也。不能动摇者，热盛于身，津液内竭，不濡灌于肌腠也。跌筋者，筋不柔和，则 蹶而如跌也。结肉者，肉无膏泽，则涩滞而如结也。诸不足者，申明中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，是诸不足之证也。久服则津液充满，故去面上之黑 ，好颜色而肌肤润泽，且轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-ndkr9i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-ndkr9i6","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愚按∶葳蕤润泽滑腻，禀性阴柔，故《本经》主治中风暴热，古方主治风温灼热，所治皆主风热之病。近医谓葳蕤有人参之功，无分寒热燥湿，一概投之，以为补剂，不知阴病内寒此为大忌，盖缘不考经书，咸为耳食所误。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-38ineg6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-38ineg6","updated":"20240616091250"}},{"ID":"20240616091250-okg4vha","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-okg4vha","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳蕤《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-wgd2hbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-wgd2hbs","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳蕤甘平治风热，四体拘挛趺筋结，风温表里是灵丹，湿毒腰疼渴且泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-c68u9k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-c68u9k7","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳，委委，美貌；蕤，实也。女人用去 斑，美颜色，故又名女萎。根叶似黄精，入药多用根。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091250-e5kfn18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091250-e5kfn18","updated":"20240616091250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主中风暴热，四肢拘挛不能动摇，趺筋结肉，一切疮疡斑剥，时行风温头疼，目痛 烂泪出，寒热心腹结气，湿毒霍乱泄泻，烦渴，腰膝痛，茎中寒。兼治虚痨客热，润心肺，补中气。晋嵇绍有胸中寒疹，每酒后苦，服之得愈。水洗，竹刀刮去皮，蜜水蒸焙干。畏卤咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091508-86ry8ry","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091508-86ry8ry"}},{"ID":"20240616091509-4dz1gyw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-4dz1gyw","updated":"20240616091513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉竹《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-of01mv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-of01mv9","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为百合科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-uyb2de8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-uyb2de8","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『常用名』尾参。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-9kfs26f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-9kfs26f","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』湖北、湖南、江西、山东等省。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-v8roedu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-v8roedu","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『采收季节』秋季采挖。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-lrk5k3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-lrk5k3n","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』鲜品洗净泥沙，晒至半干，揉去根须。干品四季用冷水抢洗，立即捞入筛内，加盖湿布，次日取出切片，晒干或烘干。若取其温补，则放蒸笼内蒸6小时取出，晒至八成干，再用上法蒸一次，以黄黑色为度。若取其滋补，则用蜜炙，每个药用蜜3两，倒入锅内炼开，再投药片，炙至金黄色摊冷，以疏散不粘手为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-8zqxc98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-8zqxc98","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』9～18克。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091509-5rs6uu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091509-5rs6uu9","updated":"20240616091509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装入缸内或箱子，加盖防潮。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091457-1vloltw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091457-1vloltw"}},{"ID":"20240616091458-nj7mbq6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091458-nj7mbq6","updated":"20240616091502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉竹《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091458-7b9sz5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091458-7b9sz5s","updated":"20240616091458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘平，补气血而润去风湿，润心肺，用代参地，不寒不燥大有殊功。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091446-wakyumf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091446-wakyumf"}},{"ID":"20240616091447-o7kw3ug","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091447-o7kw3ug","updated":"20240616091453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉竹《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091447-sa4joqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091447-sa4joqv","updated":"20240616091447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补脾润肺可填阴．有金玉威仪之象．散热搜风不碍补．具甘平润泽之功．（玉竹其根多节多须．如缨络下垂之状．而有威仪．故又一名葳蕤．色白微黄．味甘微苦．气平质润之品．培养脾肺之阴．是其所长．而搜风散热诸治．似非质润味甘之物可取效也．如风热风温之属虚者．亦可用之．考玉竹之性味功用．与黄精相似．自能推想．以风温风热之证．最易伤阴．而养阴之药．又易碍邪．惟玉竹甘平滋润．虽补而不碍邪．故古人立方有取乎此也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616091401-rynlt96","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616091401-rynlt96"}},{"ID":"20240616091413-yaekg2w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-yaekg2w","updated":"20240616091417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉竹《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-ypuqh9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-ypuqh9f","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为百合科植物玉竹的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-vucgyod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-vucgyod","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘，平。入肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-y1w5jlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-y1w5jlj","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】滋阴润肺，养胃生津。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-gcrj09a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-gcrj09a","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于肺阴受伤，肺燥咳嗽，干咳少痰，以及胃热炽盛，津伤口渴，消谷易饥等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-nsq253p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-nsq253p","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玉竹有润肺养胃、生津增液的功效，适用于肺胃燥热之症，常与沙参、麦冬、天冬等配伍同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-cuakd4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-cuakd4v","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】肥玉竹、玉竹（生用，清热养阴较好）。制玉竹（蒸熟用，专用于滋补养阴）。炒玉竹（清炒用，滋补养阴）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-v7c4kr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-v7c4kr3","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至五钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-e5ts9vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-e5ts9vt","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】1.玉竹原名为葳蕤，又称萎蕤，味甘多脂，质柔而润，长于养阴，补而不腻，故适用于内热燔灼、耗伤肺胃阴液的症候。它养阴润肺的功效，与天冬、麦冬相近似，但天冬能滋肾，麦冬可清心，玉竹则专治肺胃燥热，三者各有所长。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-flxf7rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-flxf7rl","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.本品虽为养阴之品，然无滋腻之性，故补阴而不恋邪，可用于素体阴虚、感受外邪而致发热、无汗、恶寒、咳嗽、咽干口渴等症，可与葱白、豆豉、薄荷、桔梗、白薇、甘草等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-vqp1asq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-vqp1asq","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.本品经近人作药理实验，发现有强心作用，用于临床有一定疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-ogzw6yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-ogzw6yq","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】玉竹麦门冬汤《温病条辨》：玉竹、麦冬、沙参、生甘草。治燥伤胃阴，津液亏耗。"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-6ckddvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-6ckddvg","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-iuuzhx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-iuuzhx7","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性本草》：「主时疾寒热，内补不足，去虚劳客热。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616091413-1btqf2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616091413-1btqf2f","updated":"20240616091413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「主风温自汗灼热，及劳疟寒热。」"}]},{"ID":"20240607095614-bfwbpgp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607095614-bfwbpgp"}},{"ID":"20240607095732-8mo2x0h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-8mo2x0h","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：玉竹"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-h8i2gt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-h8i2gt3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ottnl6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ottnl6f","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yù Zhú"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ofml505","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ofml505","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-379l1jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-379l1jh","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 萎蕤、玉参、尾参、铃当菜、小笔管菜、甜草根、靠山竹"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-786ih7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-786ih7g","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-j5jhh4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-j5jhh4k","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RHIZOMA POLYGONATI ODORATI"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-0nplw5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-0nplw5b","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-pbakany","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-pbakany","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为百合科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Polygonatum odoratum （Mill.）Druce的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季采挖，除去须根，洗净，晒至柔软后，反复揉搓、晾晒至无硬心，晒干；或蒸透后，揉至半透明，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-udtu868","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-udtu868","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-nhqni9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-nhqni9y","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈长圆柱形，略扁，少有分枝，长4～18cm，直径0.3～1.6cm。表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，半透明，具纵皱纹及微隆起的环节，有白色圆点状的须根痕和圆盘状茎痕。质硬而脆或稍软，易折断，断面角质样或显颗粒性。气微，味甘，嚼之发黏。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-manezt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-manezt5","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-yipvic3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-yipvic3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防霉，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-bf6qz4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-bf6qz4e","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-otiva4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-otiva4f","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，洗净，润透，切厚片或段，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-md7ikg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-md7ikg4","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-lnuh6qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-lnuh6qf","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品横切面：表皮细胞扁圆形或扁长方形，外壁稍厚，角质化。薄壁组织中散有多数黏液细胞，直径80～140μm，内含草酸钙针晶束。维管束外韧型，稀有周木型，散列。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-beci48z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-beci48z","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含量测定"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-43urv0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-43urv0y","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对照品溶液的制备 精密称取105℃ 干燥至恒重的无水葡萄糖60mg，置100ml 量瓶中，加水溶解并稀释至刻度，摇匀，即得（每1ml中含无水葡萄糖0.6mg）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-eok9017","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-eok9017","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"标准曲线的制备 精密量取对照品溶液0.0ml、1.0ml、1.5ml、2.0ml、2.5ml、3.0ml，分别置50ml量瓶中，加水至刻度，摇匀。精密量取上述各溶液2ml,置具塞试管中，分别加4％苯酚溶液1ml,混匀，迅速加入硫酸7.0ml,摇匀，于40℃水浴中保温30分钟，取出，置冰水浴中5 分钟，取出，以第一份为空白，照分光亮度法（附录ⅤB），在490nm的波长处测定吸收度，以吸收度为纵坐标，浓度为横坐标，绘制标准曲线。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-e2m6evm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-e2m6evm","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测定法 取本品粗粉1g〔同时另取本品粉末测定水分（附录Ⅸ H第一法）〕，精密称定。置圆底烧瓶中，加水100ml,加热回流1 小时，用脱脂棉滤过，如上重复提取1 次，两次滤液合并，浓缩，移至100ml 量瓶中，加水至刻度，摇匀。精密量取2ml,加乙醇10ml，搅拌，离心，取沉淀加水溶解，置50ml量瓶中，并稀释至刻度，精密量取2ml,照标准曲线的制备项下的方法，自“加4％苯酚溶液1ml ”起，依法测定吸收度，从标准曲线上读出供试品溶液中玉竹多糖含量（μg）,计算，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-59x9mxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-59x9mxw","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品按干燥品计算，含玉竹多糖以葡萄糖（C6H12O6） 计，不得少于6.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-8qan1yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-8qan1yg","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-4q36btm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-4q36btm","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-0z2pdpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-0z2pdpc","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-uvhi66o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-uvhi66o","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-2mj6f9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-2mj6f9y","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-nzlqoqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-nzlqoqv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养阴润燥，生津止渴。用于肺胃阴伤，燥热咳嗽，咽干口渴，内热消渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-9oj6g8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-9oj6g8o","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-g9k5hvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-g9k5hvs","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-5yu4raa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-5yu4raa","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-yww9ftb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-yww9ftb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-io5o7lj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-io5o7lj","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：玉竹"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-pzujki9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-pzujki9","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-f9jrrqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-f9jrrqa","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yù Zhú"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jxqo1o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jxqo1o3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-i6j90w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-i6j90w1","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 荧，委萎（《尔雅》），女萎（《本经》），萎莎（《说文》），葳蕤、王马，节地、虫蝉、乌萎（《吴普本草》），青粘、黄芝、地节（《三国志》），萎蕤、马熏（《别录》），女草、娃草、丽草（《酉阳杂俎》），葳参，玉术（《滇南本草》），萎香（《纲目》），小笔管菜（《盛京通志》），山玉竹（《铁岭县志》），十样错、竹七根、竹节黄、黄脚鸡、百解药（《贵州民间方药集》），山铃子草、铃铛菜、灯笼菜、山包米（《东北药植志》），山姜、黄蔓菁（《山东中药》），芦莉花（《黑龙江中药》），尾参（《湖南药物志》），连竹，西竹（《广"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-fi4xj6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-fi4xj6i","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-a103y40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-a103y40","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-u0zev10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-u0zev10","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-n6udg97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-n6udg97","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为百合科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、秋二季都可采挖，除去茎叶、须根和泥土，晾晒至外表有粘液渗出，轻撞去毛，分开大小个，继续晾晒至微黄色，进行揉搓、晾晒，如此反复数次，至柔润光亮、无硬心，再晒至足干：或将鲜玉竹蒸透后，边晒边揉，至柔软而透明时再晒干。收贮于干燥通风处，防霉蛀走油。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ozzms7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ozzms7z","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-307vawt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-307vawt","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山野林下或石隙间，喜阴湿处。全国大部分地区有分布，并有栽培。主产河南、江苏、辽宁、湖南、浙江。此外，安徽、江西、山东、陕西、广西、广东等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-sa1ae39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-sa1ae39","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jf48l2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jf48l2z","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高40～65厘米。地下根茎横走，黄白色，直径0.5～1.3厘米，密生多数细小的须根。茎单一，自一边倾斜，光滑无毛，具棱。叶互生于茎的中部以上，无柄；叶片略带革质，椭圆形或狭椭圆形，罕为长圆形，长6～12厘米，宽3～6厘米，先端钝尖或急尖，基部楔形，全缘，上面绿色，下面淡粉白色，叶脉隆起。花腋生，花梗长1～1.4厘米，着生花1～2朵；花被筒状，长1.4～1.8厘米，白色，先端6裂，裂片卵圆形成广卵形，带谈绿色；雄蕊6，着生于花被简的中央，花丝扁平，花药狭长圆形，黄色；子房上位，具细长花柱，柱头头状。浆果球形，直径4～7毫米，成热后紫黑色。花期4～5月。果期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-v5a8yy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-v5a8yy8","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下列同属植物，亦同等入药："}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-mjfscb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-mjfscb8","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①热河黄精，参见\"黄精\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-9b17xyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-9b17xyt","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②小玉竹：分布我国东北及河北、河南，山西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-8ojihox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-8ojihox","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③毛筒玉竹：多年生草本，高30～45厘米。叶互生；椭圆形，长7～11厘米，宽4.5～7厘米，下面稍带粉状；叶柄短。总花梗长2～2.5厘米，着生花2～5朵；基部有膜质小苞片4，披针状线形；花冠淡绿色，内侧6条脉有白色柔毛。分布吉林、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-wck37p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-wck37p2","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-kr4bimz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-kr4bimz","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥根茎，呈细长圆柱形残略扁，多不分枝，长5～15厘米，直径0.5～1厘米。表面淡黄色或淡黄棕色，半透明，稍粗糙，有细纵皱纹，节明显，呈稍隆起的波状环，节间长度多数在l厘米以下，节上有多数不规则散在的细根痕，较大的根痕呈疣状突起，有时可见圆盘状的地上茎痕迹。干燥者质坚硬，角质样而脆，受潮则变柔软。折断面带颗粒性，黄白色。气微弱，味略甜，有粘性。以条长、肉肥、黄白色，光泽柔润者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-h2enj2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-h2enj2e","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-x8mpjdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-x8mpjdt","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防霉，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-l63hd4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-l63hd4g","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-z7jqj74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-z7jqj74","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根茎含玉竹粘多糖（odoratan）及4种玉竹果聚糖（polygonatum-fructan-O-A，B，C，D），还含吖丁啶-2-羧酸（azetidin-2-carboxylic acid）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jhr2mj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jhr2mj0","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-qmbu8ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-qmbu8ok","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 玉竹：除去杂质，洗净泥土，闷润至内外湿度均匀，切片，晒干。蒸玉竹：取洗净的玉竹，置蒸器内加热蒸闷2～3次，至内外均呈黑色为度，取出，晒至半干，切片，再晒至足干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-g8924pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-g8924pf","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-0nd7bq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-0nd7bq2","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-js8hahj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-js8hahj","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"入脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-diazwbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-diazwbj","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草通玄》：\"入肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-q07kx5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-q07kx5x","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-yzkpptf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-yzkpptf","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-fqlx8o2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-fqlx8o2","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-k8gj6lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-k8gj6lh","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农：苦；桐君、雷公、扁鹊：甘，无毒；黄帝：辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-85aoi6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-85aoi6j","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"味甘微苦，性平微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-aqx8fb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-aqx8fb3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药材学》：\"味甘，性微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-8x8q4ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-8x8q4ri","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-3cw6hpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-3cw6hpb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃有痰湿气滞者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-plwxwb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-plwxwb9","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草崇原》：\"阴病内寒，此为大忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-3rqhnp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-3rqhnp8","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草备要》：\"畏咸卤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-3ri3f45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-3ri3f45","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-1viuv9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-1viuv9r","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养阴，润燥，除烦，止渴。治热病阴伤，咳嗽烦渴，虚劳发热，消谷易饥，小便频数。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-zca65v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-zca65v9","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。久服去面黑野，好颜色，润泽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-2xyz4bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-2xyz4bd","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主心腹结气虚热，湿毒腰痛，茎中寒，及目痛眦烂泪出。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-7sx2djd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-7sx2djd","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"主时疾寒热，内补不足，去虚劳客热，头痛不安。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-xhe9kfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-xhe9kfv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"主聪明，调血气，令人强壮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-4zpld5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-4zpld5f","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《四声本草》：\"补中益气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-nokqj73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-nokqj73","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《日华子本草》：\"除烦闷，止渴，润心肺，补五劳七伤，虚损，腰脚疼痛，天行热狂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-lai0di3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-lai0di3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦李杲：\"润肝，除热。\"\"主风淫四末。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-kqwioxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-kqwioxo","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《滇南本草》：\"补气血，补中健脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-4hanq01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-4hanq01","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《纲目》：\"主风温自汗灼热，及劳疟寒热，脾胃虚乏，男子小便频数，失精，一切虚损。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-26bocbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-26bocbs","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《广西中药志》：\"养阴清肺润燥。治阴虚，多汗，燥咳，肺痿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-scl7p1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-scl7p1s","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jzbj45f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jzbj45f","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～3钱；熬膏或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-upi766d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-upi766d","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-re90uwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-re90uwm","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治发热口干，小便涩：萎蕤五两。煮汁饮之。（《外台》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-2h694wb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-2h694wb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治秋燥伤胃阴：玉竹三钱，麦冬三钱，沙参二钱，生甘草一钱。水五杯，煮取二杯，分二次服。（《温病条辨》玉竹麦门冬汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-456m13l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-456m13l","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治阳明温病，下后汗出，当复其阴：沙参三钱，麦门冬五钱，冰糖一钱，细生地五钱，玉竹一钱五分（炒香）。水五杯，煮取二杯，分二次服，渣再煮一杯服。（《温病条辨》益胃汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-j5v8304","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-j5v8304","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治阴虚体感冒风温，及冬温咳嗽，咽干痰结：生萎蕤二至三钱，生葱白二至三枚，桔梗一钱至钱半，东白禳五分至一钱，淡豆豉三至四钱，苏薄荷一钱至钱半，炙草五分，红枣两枚。煎服。（《通俗伤寒论》加减萎蕤汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-tt9ufbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-tt9ufbs","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治卒小便淋涩痛：芭蕉根四两（切），萎蕤一两（锉）。上药，以水二大盏，煎至一盏三分，去滓，入滑石末三钱，搅令匀。食前分为三服，服之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-dkty7a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-dkty7a8","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治男妇虚症，肢体酸软，自汗，盗汗：葳参五钱，丹参二钱五分。不用引，水煎服。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-xurekts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-xurekts","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治赤眼涩痛：萎蕤、赤芍药、当归、黄连等分。煎汤熏洗。（《卫生家宝方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-8u619di","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-8u619di","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治眼见黑花，赤痛昏暗：萎蕤（焙）四两。为粗末，每服一钱匕，水一盏，入薄荷二叶，生姜一片，蜜少许，同煎至七分，去滓，食后临卧服。（《圣济总录》甘露汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ztuy3fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ztuy3fi","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治虚咳：玉竹五钱至一两。与猪肉同煮服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-7crow8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-7crow8o","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩玉竹30克，芭蕉120克，水煎取汁，冲入滑石粉10克，分作三次于饭前服，可治小便不畅，小便疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-gsnfjj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-gsnfjj3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾玉竹、党参、丹参各15克，川芎10克，水煎服，每日一剂，治心悸，口干，气短，胸痛或心绞痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-xh1n0ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-xh1n0ii","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿玉竹、北沙参各15克，麦冬、北五味子各10克，川贝5克，水煎服，每日一剂，可治久咳，痰少，咽干，乏力等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-xxeg567","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-xxeg567","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀玉竹、北沙参、石斛、麦冬各15克，乌梅五枚，水煎取汁，加冰糖适量代茶饮用，可治热病伤阴，或夏天出汗多引起的口干思饮，大便干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-s4z2pco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-s4z2pco","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁玉竹20～50克，猪瘦肉250克，同煮汤服食，可治久咳痰少，气虚乏力等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-3gxuh0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-3gxuh0x","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂玉竹、首乌、黄精、桑椹子各10克，水煎服，可治贫血萎黄，气阴两伤，病后体弱等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-n01zv6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-n01zv6j","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-czb4j0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-czb4j0g","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗心力衰竭：以玉竹为主，治疗风湿性心脏病、冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病、肺原性心脏病等引起的Ⅱ～Ⅲ°心力衰竭5例，服药后分别在5～10天内心衰得到控制。其中3例对洋地黄过敏，服用少量即出现明显的洋地黄过量反应，改用玉竹治疗后，心衰控制，从未发生不良反应。用法：玉竹5钱，每日1剂，水煎服。5例均停用洋地黄，仅配合应用氨茶碱及双氢克尿塞。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-5ftgs21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-5ftgs21","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ae528hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ae528hd","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 玉竹还有肥玉竹，明玉竹，尾参等别外。本品味甘，多脂，柔润可食，长于养阴，主要作用于脾胃，故久服不伤脾胃，主治肺阴虚所致的干咳少痰，咽舌燥和温热病后期，或因高烧耗伤津液而出现的津少口渴，食欲不振，胃部不适等症。本品补而不腻，不寒不燥，故有\"补益五脏，滋养气血，平补而润，兼除风热\"之功，有滋养镇静神经和强心的作用。适用于心悸、心绞痛。经现代医学研究证实，玉竹还有降血糖作用，还有润泽皮肤，消散皮肤慢性炎症和治疗跌伤扭伤的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-v8ze3vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-v8ze3vx","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ydeihwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ydeihwb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-fohs9lq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-fohs9lq","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：玉竹"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-t1p0za5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-t1p0za5","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-kkx6tzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-kkx6tzo","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yù Zhú"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-x4k2svu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-x4k2svu","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-aamqyts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-aamqyts","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 荧、委萎、女萎、萎yi、葳蕤、王马、节地、虫蝉、乌萎、青粘、黄芝、地节、萎蕤、马熏、葳参、玉术、山玉竹、笔管子、十样错、竹七根、竹节黄、黄脚鸡、百解药、山姜、黄蔓菁、尾参、连竹、西竹"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-n062k41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-n062k41","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-cajft4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-cajft4j","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fragrant Solomonseal Rhizome， Rhizome of Fragrant Solomonseal"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-zobyyzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-zobyyzs","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-me1nymv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-me1nymv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《吴普本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-fvw7b14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-fvw7b14","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使（萎蕤），勿用钩吻并黄精，其二物相似萎蕤，只是不同，有误疾人。萎蕤节上有毛，茎斑，叶尖处有小黄点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-oj16kcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-oj16kcp","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.陶弘景：《本经》有女萎无萎蕤，《别录》无女萎有萎蕤，而为用正同，疑女萎即萎蕤也，惟名异尔。今处处有，其根似黄精而小异，服食家亦用之。今市人别用一种物，根形状如续断，茎味至苦，乃言是女青根，出荆州。今疗下痢方多用女萎，而此都无止泄之说，疑"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-nqoju7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-nqoju7h","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-glttece","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-glttece","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为百合科植物玉竹的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-pr1bpmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-pr1bpmh","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Polygonatum odoratum (Mill.) Druce [P.officinale All.；P.odoratum （Mill.）Druce var.pluriflorum （Miq.）Ohwi]"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-c3s4ckw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-c3s4ckw","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：栽种3-4年后于8-9月收获，割去茎叶，挖取根茎，抖去泥沙，晒或炕到发软时，边搓揉边晒，反复数次，至柔软光滑、无硬心、色黄白时，晒干。有的产区则将鲜玉竹蒸透，边晒边搓，揉至软而透明时，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-96tli9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-96tli9o","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-9z25cro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-9z25cro","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于林下及山坡阴湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-4t73uml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-4t73uml","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、华东及陕西、甘肃、青海、台湾、河南、湖北、湖南、广东等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-hnyb0gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-hnyb0gc","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-s28ha9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-s28ha9o","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 玉竹，多年生草本。根茎横走，肉质，黄白色，密生多数须根。茎单一，高20-60cm。具7-12叶。叶互生，无柄；叶片椭圆形至卵状长圆形，长5-12cm，宽2-3cm，先端尖，基部楔形，上面绿色，下面灰色；叶脉隆起，平滑或具乳头状突起。花腋生，通常1-3朵簇生，总花梗长1-1.5cm，无苞片或有线状披针形苞片；花被筒状，全长13-20mm，黄绿色至白色，先端6裂，裂片卵圆形，长约3mm，常带绿色；雄蕊6，着生于花被筒的中部，花丝丝状，近平滑至具乳头状突起； 子房长3-4mm，花柱长10-14mm。浆果球形，直径7-10mm，熟时蓝黑色。花期4-6月，果期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-5pdmexq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-5pdmexq","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-9xu69uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-9xu69uv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学物性 宜温暖湿润气候，喜阴湿环境，较耐寒，在山区和平坝都可栽培。宜选上层深厚、肥沃、排水良好、微酸性砂质壤土栽培 。不宜在粘土、湿度过大的地方种植。忌连作。 栽培技术 用根茎繁殖。8-9月收获时，选肥壮、黄白色、个重15g以上有芽的根茎作种。随挖随栽。于畦上开横沟，行株距30cm×（13-17）cm.沟深17-20cm。栽种方法有两种，一种是双排并栽法，将根茎在沟内摆成“八字形”，其芽头一行向右，一行向左；另一种是单排密植法，即将根茎在沟中顺排摆成单行，芽头一左一右，栽后盖上腐熟干肥，再盖一层细土与畦面齐平。 田间管理 栽种后翌年春季出苗，要及时除草，须浅锄。栽种2-3年的玉竹地，早春苗未出土前可喷除草剂草甘膦，效果较好。一般每年追肥2次，第1次在春季苗高约7cm时，施入粪水；第2次在冬季倒苗后，撒施经堆沤腐熟的堆肥、厩肥或土杂肥加过磷酸钙、油饼，施后培土。 病虫害防治 病害有灰斑病，为害叶片，用1：1.5：300的波尔多液或3%井岗霉毒5×10-5液喷治。锈病，为害叶片，可喷25%粉锈宁1000倍液。虫害有蛴螬咬食根茎。用90%晶体敌百虫1000-1500倍液浇灌根部周围土壤。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-qvpgyus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-qvpgyus","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-5ky860t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-5ky860t","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 根茎圆柱形，有时有分枝，长10-20cm，直径0.7-2cm，环节明显，节间距离1-15mm，根茎中间或终端有数个圆盘状茎痕，直径0.5-1cm，有时可见残留鳞叶，须根痕点状。表面黄白色至土黄色，有细纵皱纹。质柔韧，有时干脆，易折断，断面黄白色，颗粒状，横断面可见散列维管束小点。气微，味甜，有粘性。 显微鉴别 根茎横切面 表皮细胞1列，细胞小，外被薄角质层，内皮层不明显，维管束散列，外韧型，偶见周木型。液细胞，内含草酸钙针晶束。 品质标志 《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品按干燥品计算，含玉竹多糖以葡萄糖（C6H12O6）计，不得少于6.0%。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-stinqf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-stinqf3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ptap867","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ptap867","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 100%玉竹注射液小鼠静脉注射的LD50为112.5g/kg。兔1次灌服玉竹茎叶煎剂或玉竹根茎浸膏10g/kg或静脉注射玉竹茎叶煎剂10g/kg，观察1周，一般活动正常，无死亡。玉竹根茎浸膏1次静脉注射，3只免，2只1天内死亡。认为非玉竹之毒性，而与制剂不纯有关。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-lrwf1f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-lrwf1f0","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-ypucvmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-ypucvmj","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根状茎含玉竹粘多糖（odoratan），由D-果糖，D-甘露糖，D-葡萄糖及半乳糖醛酸所组成，摩尔比为6：3：1：1.5；玉竹果聚糖（polygonatum-fructan）A、B、C、D，糖的组成为果糖（%）：葡萄糖（%）（97.5：2.6、96.2：3.8、95.3：4.8、90.4：9.6），氮杂环丁烷-2-羧酸（azetidine-2-carboxylic acid）。 还含黄精螺甾醇（polyspirostanol）Poa，黄精螺甾醇甙（poly-spirostanoside）Pob、Poc、PO1、PO2、PO3、PO4、PO5，黄精呋甾醇甙（polyfuroside），黄精呋甾醇甙Poc、Pod、PO6、PO7、PO8及PO9等甾族化合物。PO2与Pob具有相同结构，均为25-R、S立体异构混合物，只是R/S比值不同；PO3为Poc极其25-R的混合物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-pgut6l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-pgut6l5","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-nbz28t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-nbz28t0","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.对血压的影响：给麻醉兔静脉注射20%玉竹（山东崂山产）煎剂，每只1、2或5ml，均使血压缓慢上升。而麻醉犬剂量（5ml）静脉注射，血压无明显变化，但较大剂量（10ml）静脉注射可使血压短暂下降。另有报道，100%玉竹（东北玉泉产）注射液、5%或10%玉竹茎叶浸剂、10%或100%玉竹茎叶煎剂和10%玉竹根浸膏（玉竹地下茎制备的制剂），对麻醉犬、兔均有短暂降压作用。切断两侧迷走神经或注射阿托品后，降压作用减弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-7ymtvdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-7ymtvdg","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对心脏的作用：20%玉竹（山东崂山产）煎剂或玉竹酊剂，对离体蛙心小剂量（2-5滴）使心搏收缩增强，振幅加大，大剂量（10滴）使心搏减弱并迅速停止。另有报道表明，100%玉竹（东北玉泉产）注射液，对离体蛙心小剂量无影响，大剂量则抑制；对离体心脏的收缩力先抑制而后增强，对心率无影响。玉竹注射液0.2ml/kg静脉注射于家兔，对在位心脏收缩力和心率均无明显作用。对垂体后叶素所致的兔急性心肌缺血有一定保护作用。玉竹含有的甾甙，对心肌的作用与铃兰制剂类似。玉竹配糖体对离体蛙心有强心作用，玉竹煎剂的作用与玉竹配糖体类似。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-wx8uagn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-wx8uagn","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对血糖的影响：家兔以0.5g／kg浸剂肌肉注射，可使血糖上升；而口服其浸膏，血糖先升后降。加藤笃报道，玉竹的甲醇提取物的水溶部分和正丁醇部分对诱发糖尿小鼠分别在4小时后使血糖产生有意义的下降。玉竹甲醇提取物对肾上腺素所致高血糖小鼠的血糖值具有明显降低作用。并显示有改善耐糖功能的倾向。其作用机理之一是抑制了肝脏糖酵解系统。亦有报道，用玉竹灌胃大鼠对葡萄糖和四氧嘧啶引起的大鼠血糖升高有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-wvmxhc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-wvmxhc9","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.对血管的作用：蛙全身血管及下肢血管灌流实验结果表明，20%玉竹（山东崂山产）煎剂，可使血管灌流量显着减少。麻醉犬静脉注射20%玉竹煎剂10ml，可使肾容积减小。另有报道表明100%玉竹（东北玉泉产）注射液对蟾蜍下肢血管有扩张作用。离体兔耳血管灌流实验表明，100%玉竹注射液0.4ml／kg，由输液管内注入，使血管扩张。而保留神经连系的离体兔耳血管，由对侧耳静脉内注入0.4ml／kg，并不发生明显扩张，说明玉竹扩张血管的作用与神经无关。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-xn59hbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-xn59hbg","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.对血脂及实验性动脉粥祥硬化斑块的影响：锦州医学院药理教研组报道，给实验性高脂血症兔灌服100%玉竹煎剂，每5ml，每日3次，共30天，与对照组相比，在给药后10、20、30天甘油三酯、血胆固醇及B-脂蛋白均有下降。玉竹（东北玉泉产）注射液灌服或肌肉注射每日2次，共4摩根。结果表明，玉竹有预防甘油三酯上升的作用，而血胆固醇在给药后比给药前有明显增。故认为玉竹注射液对高甘油三酯血症有一定的治疗作用。对动物动脉粥样硬化斑块的形成（肉眼观察）有一定的缓解作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-1gkidq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-1gkidq3","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.对烧伤小鼠免疫功能的影响：肖锦松等报道，以玉竹的醇提物灌胃，可明显提高小鼠血清溶血素抗体水平，增强腹腔巨噬细胞的吞噬功能，改善脾淋巴细胞对ConA的增殖反应，说明玉竹可能是一种以增强体液免疫及吞噬功能为主的免疫增强剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-3n55zit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-3n55zit","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.对小鼠血清集落刺激因子的影响：肖锦松等报道，用（3）H-TdR掺入法和经典和琼脂集落培养法比较观察条件培养液（CM）中集落刺激因子（CSF）的活性，结果二法显着相关。玉竹提取物140、280、560、1120、2240mg/kg小鼠腹腔注射1次或5次后6小时血清，每孔40μl（终浓度20%），结果1次注射后血清CSF水平随着玉竹量的增加而增高，560mg/kg达高峰，后随着注射量的加大而下降，5次注射血清CSF水平几乎成一水平线，量效关系不明显，当1次注射后的血清在56℃水浴中加温30分钟，CSF水平比不加热的血清明显升高，趋势相似，也是560mg/kg时达高峰，后随着玉竹量的加大CSF水平逐渐下降。腹腔注射玉竹140mg/kg后血清CSF动态变化：腹腔注射玉竹提取物140mg/kg，1、3、6、12、24、48小时后血清，每孔40μl，结果玉竹注射后1小时血清中CSF急居上升，6小时达高峰后迅速下降，24小时接近正常水平，有明显的量效关系，在诱生CSF的同时也诱生集落抑制因子（CIF），他们参与机体的免疫及造血调节。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-rejhy4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-rejhy4b","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.对平滑肌的作用：20%玉竹煎剂可使小鼠离体肠管先兴奋后抑制。对小鼠离体子宫仅有缓和的刺激作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-agtapmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-agtapmr","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.玉竹煎剂对犬的血液凝固、尿量均无影响，亦无溶血作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-1rge9l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-1rge9l9","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.其它作用：腹腔注射100%玉竹注射液，可延长小鼠耐缺氧的时间，但死亡仍未超过30分钟。给实验性结核病小鼠饲以含2.5%玉竹的饲料，每日约食入药物50-75mg，相当于2.5-3.7g/kg，结果能降低其死亡率，但病变减轻不明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-uchfzoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-uchfzoy","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-9qr297v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-9qr297v","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 玉竹：除去杂质，洗净泥土，闷润至内外湿度均匀，切片，晒干。蒸玉竹：取洗净的玉竹，置蒸器内加热蒸闷2-3次，至内外均呈黑色为度，取出，晒至半干，切片，再晒至足干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-hb1ixot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-hb1ixot","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-njzmy0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-njzmy0b","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取粗粉约1g，加水10ml，水浴温热约30min，滤过。取滤液行下列试验：①取滤液2ml置试管中，加α-萘酚1-2滴，摇匀，沿管壁加硫酸1ml，两液面交界处显红色。（糖类反应）②取滤液2ml，加混合的Fehling试液3ml，水浴加热片刻，有砖红色沉淀产生。（糖类反应） （2）纸色谱 取本品粉末3g，加甲醇50ml，回流4h，弃去甲醇液，药渣加水适量煎2h，滤过，得滤液约20ml，加乙醇使成含醇量为65%的溶液，得白色絮状沉淀，冷藏过夜，滤过。沉淀加1mol/L硫酸1ml，置沸水浴中加热2h，成透明溶液，加水少量，用碳酸钡调至Ph6-7，滤过。滤液中加氢型强酸型阳离子树脂1勺，放置过夜，滤去树脂，滤液浓缩作供试液。另以半乳糖醛酸、甘露糖、葡萄糖为对照品。分别点样于同一Whatman NO：1滤纸上，用苯酚-水-浓氨水（40g：10ml：5滴）下行展开，以邻苯二甲酸-苯胺（1.66g：0.93ml溶于水饱和的正丁醇100ml）喷雾后105度烤20min。供试液色谱在与对照品色谱的相应位置上，显相同的色斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-me046kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-me046kq","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-tp3tr3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-tp3tr3w","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-t5sci50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-t5sci50","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-32gzrxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-32gzrxv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；平"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-1abl7ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-1abl7ve","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-i7kncwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-i7kncwf","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 痰湿气滞者禁服，脾虚便溏者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-rm48z56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-rm48z56","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jx1e90z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jx1e90z","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滋阴润肺；养胃生津。主燥咳；劳嗽；热病阴液耗伤之咽干口渴；内热消渴；阴虚外感；头昏眩晕；筋脉挛痛"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-puz49kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-puz49kf","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-drmb7bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-drmb7bz","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-12g；熬膏、浸酒或入丸、散。外用：适量，鲜品捣敷；或熬膏涂。阴虚有热宜生用，热不甚者宜制用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-sz46rtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-sz46rtz","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-dw322nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-dw322nn","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：萎蕤，性平，味甘，柔润可食。故朱肱《南阳活人书》治风温自汗身重，语言难出，用萎蕤汤以之为君药。予每用治虚劳寒热、zhan疟及一切不足之症，用代参、耆，不寒不燥，大有殊功。不止于去风热湿毒而已，此昔人所未阐者也。主风温自汗灼热，及劳疟寒热，脾胃虚乏，男子小便频数，失精，一切虚损。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-w7lffuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-w7lffuv","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：萎蕤，详味诸家所主，则知其性本醇良，气味和缓，故可长资其利，用而不穷。正如斯药之能补益五脏，滋养气血，根本既治，余疾自除。夫血为阴而主驻颜，气为阳而主轻身。阴精不足，则发虚热；肾气不固，则见骨痿及腰脚痛；虚而火炎，则头痛不安，目痛眦烂泪出；虚而热壅，则烦闷消渴；上盛下虚，则茎中寒，甚则五劳七伤，精髓日枯，而成虚损之证矣。以一药而所主多途，为效良伙，非由滋益阴精，增长阳气，其能若是乎？迹其所长，殆亦黄精之类欤。其主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉湿毒等证，皆是女萎之用，以《本经》二物混同一条故耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-p8i9ghb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-p8i9ghb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草新编》：萎蕤性纯，其功甚缓，不能救一时之急，必须多服始妙。用之于汤剂之中，冀目前之速效难矣。且萎蕤补阴，必须人参补阳，则阴阳有既济之妙，而所收之功用实奇。故中风之症，萎蕤与人参并服，必无痿废之忧；惊狂之病，萎蕤与人参同饮，断少死亡之痛。盖人参得萎蕤而益力，萎蕤得人参而鼓勇也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-dzhn5ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-dzhn5ar","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、《本草备要》：萎蕤，温润甘平，中和之品，若蜜制作丸，服之数斤，自有殊功，与服何首乌、地黄者，同一理也。若仅加数分于煎剂，以为可代参芪，则失之远矣。大抵此药性缓，久服方能见功，而所主者多风湿虚劳之缓证，故臞仙以之服食，南阳用治风温，《千金》、《外台》亦间用之，未尝恃之为重剂也。若急虚之证，必须参、芪，方能复脉回阳，斯时即用萎蕤斤许，亦不能敌参、芪数分也。（若）因李时珍有可代参、芪之语，凡遇虚证，辄加用之，曾何益于病者之分毫哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-jyhu30p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-jyhu30p","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草便读》：萎蕤，质润之品，培养肺、脾之阴，是其所长，而搜风散热诸治，似非质润味甘之物可取效也。如风热风温之属虚者，亦可用之。考玉竹之性味、功用，与黄精相似，自能推想，以风温风热之证，最易伤阴，而养阴之药，又易碍邪，唯玉竹甘平滋润，虽补而不碍邪，故古人立方有取乎此也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-efwb88n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-efwb88n","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草正义》：玉竹，味甘多脂，柔润之品，《本草》虽不言其寒，然所治皆燥热之病，其寒何如（可知）。古人以治风热，盖柔润能息风耳，阴寒之质，非能治外来之风邪。凡热邪燔灼，火盛生风之病最宜。今惟以治肺胃燥热，津液枯涸，口渴嗌干等证，而胃火炽盛，燥渴消谷，多食易饥者，尤有捷效。《千金》及朱肱以为治风温主药，正以风之病，内热蒸腾，由热生风，本非外感，而热势最盛，津液易伤，故以玉竹为之主药。甄权谓头不安者，加用此物，亦指肝火猖狂，风阳上扰之头痛，甘寒柔润，正为息风清火之妙用，岂谓其能通治一切头痛耶？《本经》诸不足三字，是总结上文暴热诸句，隐庵之言甚是。乃昔人误以为泛指诸虚不足而言。故甄权则曰内补不足；萧炳则曰补中益气；日华则曰补五劳七伤虚损；濒湖则曰主脾胃虚乏，男子小便频数失精，一切虚损，且谓治虚劳寒热，及一切不足之证，用代参、耆，不寒不燥，大有奇功，几以此为劳瘵起死回生之神剂。不知柔润之性，纯阴用事，已足以戕生生之机，况虚劳之病，阴阳并亏，纵使虚火鸱张，亦无寒凉直析之法，又岂有阴寒腻滞之质，而能补中益气之理，诸家之说，皆误读《本草经》诸不足三字之咎。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-v59too2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-v59too2","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本经》：主中风暴热，不能动摇，跌筋结肉，诸不足。久服去面黑gan，好颜色，润泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-7p566n4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-7p566n4","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《别录》：主心腹结气虚热，湿毒腰痛，茎中寒，及目痛眦烂泪出。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-mfgp5jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-mfgp5jw","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《药性论》：主时疾寒热，内补不足，去虚劳客热，头痛不安。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-k6ye84t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-k6ye84t","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草拾遗》：主聪明，调血气，令人强壮。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-725lt6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-725lt6m","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《四声本草》：补中益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-up8rlwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-up8rlwl","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《日华子本草》：除烦闷，止渴，润心肺，补五劳七伤，虚损，腰脚疼痛，天行热狂。7、李杲：润肝，除热。主风淫四末。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-egef7f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-egef7f6","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《滇南本草》：补气血，补中健脾。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-2w5f7vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-2w5f7vh","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14.《广西中药志》：养阴清肺润燥。治阴虚，多汗，燥咳，肺痿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-j36cjjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-j36cjjb","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095732-twwkpd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095732-twwkpd0","updated":"20240607095732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095733-nuydrvi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607095733-nuydrvi"}},{"ID":"20240607095816-rloanoj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-rloanoj","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：女萎"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-79q1fx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-79q1fx2","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-dk55yfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-dk55yfp","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Nǚ Wěi"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-6ie3d97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-6ie3d97","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ub5waox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ub5waox","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 小木通[云南]、白木通[湖南]、粗糠藤、万年藤、穿山藤、小叶鸭脚力刚、钥匙藤"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-9h3wdog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-9h3wdog","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-o69bn5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-o69bn5y","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 毛茛科铁丝莲属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女萎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Clematis apiifolia DC.，以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根、茎藤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全株"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。秋季采收，扎成小把，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-vwu8ptw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-vwu8ptw","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-n3nnbwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-n3nnbwp","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温。有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-hx6mhj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-hx6mhj5","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-idtlr25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-idtlr25","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 消炎消肿，利尿通乳。用于肠炎，痢疾，甲状腺肿大，风湿关节疼痛，尿路感染，乳汁不下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-p8j4jgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-p8j4jgo","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-b9wcut5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-b9wcut5","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～5钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-q3uzb0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-q3uzb0m","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-mdgkl4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-mdgkl4y","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-iz87a83","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-iz87a83","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：女萎"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-wqpclg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-wqpclg7","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-10dk5dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-10dk5dn","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Nǚ Wěi"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-yfll2a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-yfll2a8","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-omh5qtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-omh5qtr","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蔓楚（《唐本草》），牡丹蔓（《植物学大辞典》），山木通、木通草、白木通、穿山藤、苏木通（《湖南药物志》），小叶鸭脚力刚、钥匙藤（《浙江天目山药植志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-flt754b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-flt754b","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-2qknrxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-2qknrxv","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 李当之《药录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ycukok9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ycukok9","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-fvhvdlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-fvhvdlh","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为毛茛科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女萎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季采收，取地上茎，剥去祖皮，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-i91easw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-i91easw","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-zopzvag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-zopzvag","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长山野，亦有栽培。分布湖南、安徽、江苏、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-axdg7mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-axdg7mt","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-l5l255v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-l5l255v","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 落叶攀援藤本。茎近方形，紫色，被白色柔毛。3出复叶，对生，小叶卵形，长2～6.5厘米，宽1.2～5.5厘米，中间小叶较大，上部有时3裂，基部圆形，先端尖，边缘中部以上具2～3缺刻状钝齿，中部以下全缘，两面均被伏短白毛；叶柄细长。圆锥状聚伞花序；花白色，径约2厘米；萼片4，外面密被毛，内面无毛；无花瓣；雄蕊多数，花药较花丝短，黄色；心皮多数，被短毛，花柱有长白毛。瘦果狭斜卵形，长约5毫米，花柱不落而延长。花期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-dkeu7np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-dkeu7np","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ffenxkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ffenxkc","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含槲皮素、有机酸，甾醇及少量生物碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-95htu2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-95htu2b","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ajjorob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ajjorob","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《唐本草》：\"味辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-zbk4img","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-zbk4img","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-lphtqpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-lphtqpj","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治泻痢脱肛，惊痫寒热，妊妇浮肿，筋骨疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-s3trtn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-s3trtn9","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①李当之《药录》：\"止下，消食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-n47sqxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-n47sqxo","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"主风寒洒洒，霍乱泄痢，肠鸣游气上下无常，惊痫，寒热百病，出汗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-hkp8wjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-hkp8wjj","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《湖南药物志》：\"治妊妇浮肿，项下瘿瘤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-i119svk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-i119svk","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-9mxjbv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-9mxjbv9","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或入丸剂。外用：烧烟熏。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-r91fhkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-r91fhkc","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-jgfshmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-jgfshmp","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治久痢脱肛：女萎（切）一升，烧熏之。（《产乳集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-z39qr0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-z39qr0y","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治筋骨疼痛：女萎藤五钱，蔓性千斤拔五钱，路边荆三钱，老钩藤二钱。水煎服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-r2liq3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-r2liq3d","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-xtzimzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-xtzimzg","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-0lzyznx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-0lzyznx","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：女萎"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-lo6yz2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-lo6yz2o","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-irabi5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-irabi5t","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Nǚ Wěi"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-qdijj4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-qdijj4z","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-3rlr2ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-3rlr2ti","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蔓楚、牡丹蔓、山木通、木通草、白木通、穿山藤、苏木通、小叶鸭脚力刚、钥匙藤、花木通、菊叶威灵仙"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-qvfuzhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-qvfuzhz","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-k1yc1r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-k1yc1r9","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" stem of October clematis"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ix8672r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ix8672r","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-n8sofak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-n8sofak","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 李当之《药录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-u2w6oom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-u2w6oom","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-o035bcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-o035bcj","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为毛茛科植物女萎的藤茎、叶或根。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-vwzrftm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-vwzrftm","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Clematis apiifolia DC."}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-twb7fmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-twb7fmh","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季开花时采收带叶茎蔓，扎成小把，晒干或随时采用鲜品。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-eo88yoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-eo88yoi","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-d6ehvzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-d6ehvzl","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔150-1000m的山野林边。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-cd53qa6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-cd53qa6","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于江苏南部、安徽大别山以南、浙江、江西、福建、湖南。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-kcxttf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-kcxttf6","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-qy8k7p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-qy8k7p6","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 女萎，藤本。小枝密生贴伏短柔毛。叶对生；叶柄长1.5-7cm；三出复叶，小叶片卵形或宽卵形，长2.5-8cm，宽1.5-7cm，通常有不明显的3浅裂，边缘有锯齿，或有缺刻状的粗锯齿或牙齿，上面疏生贴伏短柔毛或无毛，下面通常疏生短柔毛，或仅沿叶脉生较密短柔毛。圆锥状聚伞花序，多花，花序梗、花梗密生贴伏短柔毛，花梗上小苞片小，钻形或无；两性花，直径1-1.5cm；萼片4，狭倒卵形，长7-8mm，白色，开展，两面有短柔毛，外面较密；花瓣无；雄蕊多数，无毛，长4-6mm，花丝比花药长约5倍；心皮少数，被短柔毛。瘦果狭卵形，长3-5mm，不扁，有短柔毛，宿存花柱羽毛状，长1.2-1.5cm。花期7-9月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-wy07gcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-wy07gcu","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ey9t3l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ey9t3l2","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.性状鉴别 茎类方形，长可达数米，缠绕或切段，直径1-5mm。表面灰绿色或棕绿色，通常有6条较明显的纵棱，被白色柔毛，质脆，易断，断面不平坦，木部黄白色，可见多数细导管孔，髓部疏松。叶对生，三出复叶，叶片多皱缩破碎，完整的叶片卵形或宽卵形，顶生小叶片较两侧小叶片大，常呈不明显的3浅裂，边缘有缺刻状粗锯齿或牙齿，暗绿色，两面有短柔毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-oclb49o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-oclb49o","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总叶柄长2-9cm，常扭曲。有的带有花果。气微，味微苦涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-4mzvh35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-4mzvh35","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别 茎横切面：为六角形。表皮细胞类长方形，切向延长。皮层较狭。中柱鞘纤维1-2层，断续相接成环（嫩茎无纤维）；无限外韧型维管束，大小相间排列，形成层不明显，导管类图形或长圆形，多单个排列，直径50-250μm。髓部较小，约占茎的1／4-1／2，细胞类圆形。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-5500pff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-5500pff","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-992mu2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-992mu2w","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根含乙酰齐墩果酸（acetyl Oleanolic acid），齐墩果酸（oleanoic acid），常春藤皂甙元（hederagenin），豆甾醇（stigrnasterol），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol）；花、叶含槲素（quercetin），山柰酚（kaempferol）等黄酮类化合物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-xmrw3ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-xmrw3ug","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-s8twjwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-s8twjwq","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取粗粉1g，加甲醇10ml，回流提取约15min，滤过。取滤液1ml，加醋酸铅试液1滴，溶液立即产生绿色沉淀。另取滤液滴于6cm圆形滤纸上，滴加氯仿展开，烘干，喷1％三氯化铝乙醇液，再烘干，紫外光灯下观察，中心部有黄绿色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ahuzs4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ahuzs4m","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取粗粉2g，加甲醇20ml，回流20min，滤过。浓缩成3ml，吸取10μl点于中华层析纸上，以正丁醇-醋酸-水-氯仿（8：2：10：1）的上层液为展开刘展开，取出，晾干，喷以1％三氯化铝乙醇液，烘干，于紫外光灯下观察，可见棕色、蓝色、黄绿色3个斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-sxmxozz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-sxmxozz","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-hesew34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-hesew34","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝；脾；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-aycq303","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-aycq303","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-mxze449","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-mxze449","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性温；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ka6n8cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ka6n8cf","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-wdvxle1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-wdvxle1","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品内服剂量不可过大，否则可引起胃部不适，呕吐，腹泻，食欲大减，头痛，胸闷，四肢无力或面部浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-ip0mqf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-ip0mqf3","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-y6qkv2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-y6qkv2r","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风除湿，温中理气，利尿，消食。。主主治风湿痹证，吐泻；痢疾；腹痛肠鸣；小便不利；水肿"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-0rp4fa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-0rp4fa4","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-fnpdw9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-fnpdw9j","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，15～30g。外用：适量，鲜品捣敷；或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-spl8j0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-spl8j0w","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-e2jamv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-e2jamv5","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1、李当之《药录》：止下，消食。2、《唐本草》：主风寒洒洒，霍乱泄痢，肠鸣游气上下无常，惊痫，寒热百病，出汗。3、《湖南药物志》：治妊妇浮肿，项下瘿瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-wz3b4f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-wz3b4f2","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607095816-5whvj2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095816-5whvj2e","updated":"20240607095816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607095818-tp5jauw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607095818-tp5jauw"}},{"ID":"20240607095819-vznbr29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607095819-vznbr29"}}]}